{"id":"n87604-1-8","stage":2,"title":"화창하다 · 和畅","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87604-1-8-1","ko":"이렇게 화창한 날씨에는 소풍을 가야 하는데!","zh":"天气这么好的日子，应该去野餐才对啊！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"화창한","meaning":"和畅，风和日丽","explanation":"화창하다：和畅，风和日丽；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"화창하다","audio":"/audio/cb258117fa834fffbebb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87604","senseId":"1","lemma":"화창하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화창한","audio":"/audio/e0927288ed020999ae4f.mp3"}},{"text":"날씨에는","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"날씨에는","audio":"/audio/0ce209a39b658e599d0e.mp3"}},{"text":"소풍을","meaning":"远足，郊游，野游","explanation":"소풍：远足，郊游，野游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소풍","audio":"/audio/687c92f20434bf39a11f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26854","senseId":"1","lemma":"소풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소풍을","audio":"/audio/c4a7007301a0b521ee0e.mp3"}},{"text":"가야","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가야","audio":"/audio/6aca1779d1b3c7fc08b4.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데!","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"cb258117fa834fff","term":"화창하다","zh":"和畅，风和日丽","audio":"/audio/cb258117fa834fffbebb.mp3","entryId":"87604","definition":"天气晴朗温暖，有柔风。","pronunciation":["화창하다"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"687c92f20434bf39","term":"소풍","zh":"远足，郊游，野游","audio":"/audio/687c92f20434bf39a11f.mp3","entryId":"26854","definition":"为了享受美景或做游戏而去野外。","pronunciation":["소풍"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fd0aefa47f4b441f6c4e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87604-1-8-2","ko":"그럼 산책이라도 할까요?","zh":"那咱们去散散步怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"산책이라도","meaning":"散步","explanation":"산책：散步；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"산책","audio":"/audio/b745d43721954853192d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62506","senseId":"1","lemma":"산책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산책이라도","audio":"/audio/3a6a15386872b459f6f0.mp3"}},{"text":"할까요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할까요","audio":"/audio/289dd8e3438eab1f235b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"b745d43721954853","term":"산책","zh":"散步","audio":"/audio/b745d43721954853192d.mp3","entryId":"62506","definition":"为了稍作休息或身体健康而在附近慢慢地走路。","pronunciation":["산ː책"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f192864818b1e77928c6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.293,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87604","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1197,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["天气这么好的日子，应该去野餐才对啊！","那咱们去散散步怎么样？","这个和刚才那个有什么不同吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["天气这么好的日子，应该去野餐才对啊！","那咱们去散散步怎么样？","这个和刚才那个有什么不同吗？"],"answer":1}]}
